### Kør dem i IntelliJ med den grønne pil. IntelliJ husker session-cookien, så log ind først (afsnit A).
### Samme kald kan laves i Postman: husk Body -> raw -> JSON.
###
### Testdata fra InitData:
### Sale: 1 = Sal 1 (20 x 12, sæde-id 1-240), 2 = Sal 2 (25 x 16, sæde-id 241-640)
### Film: 1 = Jaws, 2 = The Notebook, 3 = Mad Max (premiere), 4 = Spirited Away, 5 = Alien (begge coming soon)
### Forestillinger: 1 = Jaws kl. 17, 2 = Jaws kl. 20, 3 = The Notebook, 4 = Mad Max
### Billettyper: 1 = Voksen 120, 2 = Barn 80, 3 = Pensionist 95
### Booking 1 = David, sæde 1 (række 1, sæde 1) til forestilling 2
### Medarbejdere (kode123): mads = Admin + Clerk, sofie = Clerk, oliver = Operator + MovieEditor, emma = Inspector


### ============ A. Login (medarbejder) ============

### A1. Log ind som admin (forventet: 200 med navn og roller)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mads", "password": "kode123" }

### A2. Hvem er jeg? (forventet: 200, eller 401 hvis man ikke er logget ind)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me

### A3. Log ud (forventet: 204)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout

### A4. Forkert adgangskode (forventet: 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mads", "password": "forkert" }


### ============ B. Film: se (ISSUE-12) ============

### B1. Film på programmet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies

### B2. Filtrér på genre og søgetekst
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies?genre=HORROR&search=jaws

### B3. Én film (forventet: 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1

### B4. Film der ikke findes (forventet: 404 med {"error": ...})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/9999

### B5. Kommende forestillinger for én film
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1/showings

### B6. Alle film, også dem der er taget af programmet (kræver login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/all

### B7. Genrer til en dropdown
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/genres


### ============ C. Film: opret, ret, fjern (ISSUE-8, kræver MovieEditor eller Admin) ============

### C1. Opret film (forventet: 201, id 6). runTime er i sekunder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inception",
  "runTime": 8880,
  "description": "En tyv stjæler hemmeligheder ved at trænge ind i folks drømme.",
  "imdbRating": 8.8,
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "releaseDate": "2010-07-16",
  "ageRestriction": 11,
  "genre": "SCIFI",
  "premiereDate": "2026-12-01",
  "posterUrl": null
}

### C2. Ret film 6 (forventet: 200). PUT erstatter alle felter, så send dem alle
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inception",
  "runTime": 8880,
  "description": "Ny beskrivelse",
  "imdbRating": 8.8,
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "releaseDate": "2010-07-16",
  "ageRestriction": 15,
  "genre": "SCIFI",
  "premiereDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### C3. Ret uden navn (forventet: 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/6
Content-Type: application/json

{ "runTime": 8880 }

### C4. Ret film der ikke findes (forventet: 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Findes ikke", "runTime": 6000 }

### C5. Slet film 6 helt (forventet: 204, fordi den ingen forestillinger har)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/movies/6

### C6. Slet Jaws (forventet: 409, fordi den har forestillinger)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1

### C7. Tag The Notebook af programmet (forventet: 200, active false, og dens forestillinger aflyses)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/2/deactivate

### C8. Sæt den på programmet igen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/2/activate


### ============ D. Sale og kapacitet (ISSUE-9) ============

### D1. Alle sale med capacity (forventet: 240 og 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auditoriums

### D2. Opret en ny sal (kræver Admin, forventet: 201 med capacity 80). Sæderne oprettes automatisk
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auditoriums
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sal 3", "rowCount": 10, "seatsPerRow": 8 }

### D3. Gør Sal 3 større (forventet: capacity 120)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/auditoriums/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sal 3", "rowCount": 12, "seatsPerRow": 10 }

### D4. Sæderne i en sal
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auditoriums/3/seats

### D5. Luk Sal 3 (forventet: 200, active false). Sal 1 kan ikke lukkes, fordi den har forestillinger (409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/auditoriums/3/close

### D6. Åbn den igen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/auditoriums/3/open


### ============ E. Promovering (ISSUE-10) ============

### E1. Fremhævede film til forsiden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/promoted

### E2. Coming soon (premieren ligger i fremtiden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/coming-soon

### E3. Premierefilm (premiere inden for de seneste 14 dage)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/premieres

### E4. Fremhæv Jaws (kræver MovieEditor eller Admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1/promote

### E5. Fjern fremhævningen igen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1/unpromote


### ============ F. Forestillinger ============

### F1. Programmet de næste 3 måneder (capacity og availableSeats er med)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/showings

### F2. Filtrér på film og dato (ret datoen til i morgen)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/showings?movieId=1&date=2026-10-09

### F3. Sædeoversigt for Jaws kl. 20 (sæde 1 er booket)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/showings/2/seats

### F4. Planlæg en ekstra forestilling (kræver MovieEditor; ret datoen til en dag inden for 3 måneder)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/showings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "movieId": 2, "auditoriumId": 1, "startTime": "2026-11-01T14:00:00" }

### F5. Overlap i samme sal (forventet: 409, hvis F4 er kørt)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/showings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "movieId": 1, "auditoriumId": 1, "startTime": "2026-11-01T15:00:00" }

### F6. Aflys forestilling 4
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/showings/4/cancel

### F7. Alle forestillinger, også aflyste (kræver login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/showings/all


### ============ G. Booking ============

### G1. Billettyper
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ticket-types

### G2. Book to sæder som gæst: en voksen og et barn (forventet: 201, seatCodes ["1-2","1-3"])
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": null,
  "guestName": "Anna",
  "guestMail": "anna@email.dk",
  "showingId": 2,
  "seats": [
    { "seatId": 2, "ticketTypeId": 1 },
    { "seatId": 3, "ticketTypeId": 2 }
  ]
}

### G3. Book et sæde der allerede er taget (forventet: 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName": "Bo",
  "guestMail": "bo@email.dk",
  "showingId": 2,
  "seats": [ { "seatId": 1, "ticketTypeId": 1 } ]
}

### G4. Book et sæde fra Sal 2 til en forestilling i Sal 1 (forventet: 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName": "Bo",
  "guestMail": "bo@email.dk",
  "showingId": 2,
  "seats": [ { "seatId": 300, "ticketTypeId": 1 } ]
}

### G5. Detaljer, pris og billet for booking 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/price

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/ticket

### G6. Betal booking 2 (forventet: 200. Anden gang: 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/pay

### G7. Billetkontrol (kræver Inspector, Clerk eller Admin. Forventet: 200. Anden gang: 409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/check-in

### G8. Ekspedienten finder bookinger på email eller forestilling (kræver login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings?email=anna@email.dk

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings?showingId=2

### G9. Annullér booking 2. Kunder skal sende deres email med, medarbejdere behøver ikke (forventet: 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2?email=anna@email.dk


### ============ H. Kunder ============

### H1. Registrér en kunde (forventet: 201 med id, navn og email, uden password)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lucas", "email": "lucas@mail.dk", "password": "hemmelig123", "birthday": "2000-01-01" }

### H2. Kunde-login (forventet: 200. Forkert adgangskode: 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lucas@mail.dk", "password": "hemmelig123" }

### H3. Davids bookinger
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/bookings


### ============ I. Medarbejdere (kræver Admin) ============

### I1. Alle medarbejdere
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees

### I2. Roller der kan vælges
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/roles

### I3. Ansæt en ny medarbejder (forventet: 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Noah",
  "username": "noah",
  "email": "noah@kino.dk",
  "password": "kode123",
  "phoneNr": "12345678",
  "roles": ["Clerk"]
}

### I4. Ret medarbejder 5. Uden "password" beholdes den gamle adgangskode
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/employees/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Noah",
  "username": "noah",
  "email": "noah@kino.dk",
  "roles": ["Clerk", "MovieEditor"]
}

### I5. Slet medarbejder 5 (forventet: 204. Man kan ikke slette sig selv eller den sidste Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/employees/5

### I6. Opret en ny rolle
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleName": "Cleaner" }

### I7. Ny billettype og ny pris
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ticket-types
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticketName": "Studerende", "price": 90 }

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ticket-types/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticketName": "Voksen", "price": 130 }
